From b94396f709d5e9fc6e714f822d5a923caa7ce1f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:43:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] S3-15: late scene changes: only the audited tail calls
 wait (scene_push_late / scene_set_late)

The first cut held back every enter() made inside an update; with it on, the native
home_visit script showed order dependencies. Now only callers that do nothing after
the call (island menu entries, R/L/SELECT, the apartments, family, graveyard, news and
shop exits to the island, the new-island build) ask for it. Measured: new island ->
hub 4 reads -> 2, island -> family 3 -> 1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xd63cvyt9PpfrF57wBDFeR
