+/* S3-15: scene_set / scene_push for a caller that does nothing after the call that needs the new scene's enter()
+ * to have run (the call is the last thing its update() does, bar a return). On the PS1, when the new scene's code
+ * is not loaded, enter() then runs after update() has returned (scene.c): one overlay read instead of three. */
+void scene_set_late(const DoomoScene *s, int arg);
+void scene_push_late(const DoomoScene *s, int arg);
