- * entering s would first have to load its code. A scene change made from inside a scene's update (or a modal's
- * callback) then runs s's enter() when that call has returned, not inside it (scene.c). NULL = always at once. --- */
+ * entering s would first have to load its code. A scene_set_late / scene_push_late made from inside a scene's
